abstract: >
  QERRA-v2 Classical is a fully explainable, classical ethical evaluation
  engine based on the SEMEV-12 framework — 12 immutable, human-centred
  ethical vectors. Designed for robotics, human-AI collaboration, and
  high-stakes decision support. No neural networks. No black boxes.
